Package: normanR
Title: Client for the Norman Network REST API
Version: 1.3.77
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Rafal", "Urniaz", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0192-2165"),
		  email = "rafal.urniaz@cantab.net", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Provides a programmatic interface to interact with the Norman 
    Network REST API. The package enables users to easily query, retrieve, 
    and parse environmental chemistry data, emerging substances lists, and 
    mass spectrometry workflows. All data frames are structured to facilitate 
    subsequent environmental data analysis and ecotoxicological modeling.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/urniaz/normanR
BugReports: https://github.com/urniaz/normanR/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
